[lib/src/session/session_repo.dart#66B2]
1:/// Session repository: creates, lists, opens, deletes, and forks JSONL
2:/// sessions on top of a [FileSystem], managing session ids and paths per
3:/// pi's on-disk scheme.
4:///
5:/// Ported from pi-mono `packages/agent/src/harness/session/jsonl-repo.ts`
6:/// (`JsonlSessionRepo`) and `repo-utils.ts`. Layout:
7:/// `<sessionsRoot>/<--encoded-cwd-->/<timestamp>_<sessionId>.jsonl`.
