28:/// Where a fork cut point sits relative to [JsonlSessionRepo.fork]'s
29:/// `entryId`.
30:enum ForkPosition {
31:  /// The fork contains everything *before* the entry (which must be a user
32:  /// message) — i.e. the conversation is rewound to re-ask it.
33:  before,
34:
35:  /// The fork contains the entry itself and everything before it.
36:  at,
37:}
