110:String _encodeCwd(String cwd) {
111:  final normalized = cwd.replaceAll(RegExp(r'[/\\]+$'), '');
112:  return '--${normalized.replaceFirst(RegExp(r'^[/\\]'), '').replaceAll(RegExp(r'[/\\:]'), '-')}--';
113:}
114:
115:/// The per-project directory slug used under the sessions root
116:/// (`/work` → `--work--`). Public so sibling stores (e.g. the messaging
117:/// fabric root) colocate with the project's sessions.
118:String encodeSessionCwd(String cwd) => _encodeCwd(cwd);
119:
120:/// Reverses [encodeSessionCwd]: `--Users-Uladzimir_Klyshevich-git-dm.ai--`
121:/// → `/Users/Uladzimir_Klyshevich/git/dm.ai`.
122:///
123:/// Returns `null` if [slug] is not wrapped in `--` or decodes to an empty path.
124:String? decodeSessionCwd(String slug) {
125:  if (slug.length < 4 || !slug.startsWith('--') || !slug.endsWith('--')) {
126:    return null;
127:  }
128:  final inner = slug.substring(2, slug.length - 2);
129:  if (inner.isEmpty) return null;
130:  final parts = inner.split('-');
131:  if (parts.isEmpty || parts.any((p) => p.isEmpty)) return null;
132:  return '/${parts.join('/')}';
133:}
134:
135:/// Creates a new session id (time-ordered uuidv7).
136:String createSessionId() => uuidv7();
137:
138:/// Sorts by latest activity (file mtime), falling back to creation time so
139:/// stable ordering is guaranteed even when mtimes are equal.
140:int compareSessionActivity(SessionMetadata a, SessionMetadata b) {
141:  final aTime = a.lastUpdatedAt ?? a.createdAt;
142:  final bTime = b.lastUpdatedAt ?? b.createdAt;
143:  final result = bTime.compareTo(aTime);
144:  if (result != 0) return result;
145:  return b.createdAt.compareTo(a.createdAt);
146:}
147:
148:/// Orders sessions for display (issue #83): sessions from the [currentCwd]
149:/// folder first, then sessions from every other folder; each group
150:/// newest-activity first. [JsonlSessionRepo.list] stays plain activity
151:/// order so `/resume` keeps its most-recent-anywhere semantics.
152:List<SessionMetadata> sortSessionsCurrentFolderFirst(
153:  List<SessionMetadata> sessions,
154:  String? currentCwd,
155:) {
156:  final sorted = [...sessions]..sort(compareSessionActivity);
157:  if (currentCwd == null || currentCwd.isEmpty) return sorted;
158:  return [
159:    ...sorted.where((m) => m.cwd == currentCwd),
160:    ...sorted.where((m) => m.cwd != currentCwd),
161:  ];
