/// File-based messaging repository. Layout:
///
/// ```
/// <root>/<agentId>/inbox/<timestamp>_<rand>.json   (unread, name-ordered)
/// <root>/<agentId>/read/<timestamp>_<rand>.json    (consumed)
/// ```
