/// owns `<root>/<agent>/inbox/*.json` (unread) and `<root>/<agent>/read/`
/// (consumed). Two Fa instances sharing one root (e.g. the session repo of
/// one project) exchange messages through the filesystem — no live process
/// coupling needed.
