I have a good picture now. Let me write the RCA first, then the failing reproduction tests (RED), then the fix (GREEN).

Plan of changes:

### 1. `lib/src/session_repo.dart`
- `_encodeCwd`: percent-escape `%` → `%25`, `/` → `%2F`, `\` → `%5C`, `:` → `%3A` (after trailing-slash trim and leading-slash strip).
- `decodeSessionCwd`: if inner contains a reversible escape (`%25|%2F|%5C|%3A`, case-insensitive) → unescape and return as a single absolute path (validating no empty segments after unescape); else legacy split.

